👉 Flow:



Data comes from Duck Creek (WINS/CIP) into Tactical GDW as daily transactions
Data is converted into inbound files and sent to the SRM Application
SRM App processes and stores data in SRM DB
From SRM, outbound files are generated
These files are sent to downstream systems like GDW, FPSL, and FSCD

